  "bounds": [
    "An echoed command is software/bus evidence. Wheel speed and phase channels are separate physical-response telemetry. The release supplies no calibrated independent shaft torque sensor or specified conversion of those current counts to A or Nm.",
    "The pre-limit per-wheel request, actual motor PWM, drive-voltage limit, high-rate encoder clocks, dedicated experimental calibration or excitation signal are unavailable in this audit. Reaching a slew increment by itself does not prove the hidden desired value exceeded it.",
    "Timestamp differences compare host event times of send, decode and reporting. Multiple frames can share one packet timestamp, repeated commands can produce many report matches, and feedback frames can serve multiple neighboring sends. Matching is descriptive, not a physical delay measurement or proof of controller causation.",
    "Split consists of contiguous or potentially related segments of the same indoor collection. A training or held-out split is not supplied beyond the single public train split. No inference of independent experiments or model generalization."
  ],
