    "notes": "fetch_body.py downloads pinned archive tree if absent, validates compressed archive lengths/LFS SHA-256, and locally extracts only .rlog.bz2 entries. derive_body.py fetches missing schemas at the pinned cereal revision and SHA-256 verifies each before decode. GitHub CLI is an optional transport fallback if both GitHub HTTP endpoints fail. Each needed schema can also be placed at its recorded-schema path and is checked by digest. Compare output hashes; neither a robot nor an openpilot installation is required.",
